# Base URL of the Foresight backend (foresight-server). Leave UNSET normally:
# a production build then talks to its own origin (the backend serves it), and
# the dev server talks to port 3199 on the host you opened it on. Set it only
# when the API lives on a different origin.
# The LiveKit ws URL is NOT configured here — it always comes from /rt/token responses.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3199
